個精光\n\n麵量中份我吃起來剛好很飽很滿足\n\n#台大校園美食 #復興南路美食 #拉麵 #沾麵 #麵屋壹の",null,[0,30]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11227828546023699830/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlNhWEF0T1hSM1JSQUIQAQ%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11227828546023699830/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlNhWEF0T1hSM1JSQUIQAQ%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/11227828546023699830/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlNhWEF0T1hSM1JSQUIQAQ%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11227828546023699830/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlNhWEF0T1hSM1JSQUIQAQ%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11227828546023699830/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlNhWEF0T1hSM1JSQUIQAQ%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11227828546023699830/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlNhWEF0T1hSM1JSQUIQAQ%3D%3D"]],[null,null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/@/data\u003d!4m7!23m6!1m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURSaXAtOXR3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xe97b5718cb4cbd23!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDRip-9twE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURSaXAtOXR3RRAB\u0026t\u003d3\u0026entityid\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURSaXAtOXR3RRItChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURSaXAtOWR3EhNDZ3dJd3FXUG9nWVFxSnJteVFNIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARI71MyxhXe-kqCzBaRnhBMXRETm9j\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjXpN6699mWAxVXs1YBHZasGqEQoykIrwIoBw"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwiWjeS699mWAxXi8BYFHb53NGQQ0pMFCNkBKAk"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjXpN6699mWAxVXs1YBHZasGqEQ0pMFCKECKAE"],[["ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURXOVllNFFREAE",["0x0:0xe97b5718cb4cbd23",null,1648709339089474,1648709339089474,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103609703495189635981/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["陳品誠","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWLFD9GuvV